From 09878fb07332faa0621f525c33eb2857e8c82d4a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian Clarke <sanity@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Mar 2026 14:20:38 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 29/69] fix(ui): use execCommand fallback for clipboard copy in
 sandboxed iframe

The Freenet gateway iframe sandbox doesn't include allow-clipboard-write,
so navigator.clipboard.write_text() fails and freezes the UI. Replace all
4 clipboard usages with a shared copy_to_clipboard() utility that uses
document.execCommand('copy') via a temporary textarea, which works in
sandboxed iframes.

Fixes #135 (third bullet - copy buttons lock up interface)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
